{"id": "hkust-canvas-c18b7b5b3bfea95d", "text": "主题：1. 登录与设备\n问题：如何登录 Canvas？\n回答：打开 https://canvas.ust.hk，选择正确的账号类型，使用完整的主邮箱地址（例如 account@connect.ust.hk）及密码登录，不能只填写账号名。登录问题按原文可联系 ITSO：cchelp@ust.hk，电话 2358-6200。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2 页", "question": "如何登录 Canvas？", "answer": "打开 https://canvas.ust.hk，选择正确的账号类型，使用完整的主邮箱地址（例如 account@connect.ust.hk）及密码登录，不能只填写账号名。登录问题按原文可联系 ITSO：cchelp@ust.hk，电话 2358-6200。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "1. 登录与设备", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [2], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://canvas.ust.hk/", "mailto:cchelp@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-1a24546755026735", "text": "主题：1. 登录与设备\n问题：浏览器和电脑有什么要求？\n回答：使用能够运行较新浏览器的操作系统，并更新 Chrome、Firefox、Edge 或 Safari。浏览器需启用 Cookies 和 JavaScript。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2 页", "question": "浏览器和电脑有什么要求？", "answer": "使用能够运行较新浏览器的操作系统，并更新 Chrome、Firefox、Edge 或 Safari。浏览器需启用 Cookies 和 JavaScript。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "1. 登录与设备", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [2], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://canvas.ust.hk/", "mailto:cchelp@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-46a5bba2ce299382", "text": "主题：1. 登录与设备\n问题：手机可以使用吗？出现故障怎么办？\n回答：可以通过手机浏览器或 Instructure 官方 Canvas 应用访问，在应用中搜索 canvas.ust.hk，再使用 HKUST 账号登录。部分功能可能受设备限制。\n\n排查顺序：更新应用 → 检查网络 → 清理缓存 → 必要时重新安装 → 改用浏览器或电脑。\n\n- iOS：Settings → Canvas → 开启 Reset cache on next launch。\n- Android：Settings → Apps → Canvas → Storage → Clear Cache/Data。\n\n原指南建议，提交作业和参加测验，尤其是影响成绩的重要考核，应使用电脑。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、4 页", "question": "手机可以使用吗？出现故障怎么办？", "answer": "可以通过手机浏览器或 Instructure 官方 Canvas 应用访问，在应用中搜索 canvas.ust.hk，再使用 HKUST 账号登录。部分功能可能受设备限制。\n\n排查顺序：更新应用 → 检查网络 → 清理缓存 → 必要时重新安装 → 改用浏览器或电脑。\n\n- iOS：Settings → Canvas → 开启 Reset cache on next launch。\n- Android：Settings → Apps → Canvas → Storage → Clear Cache/Data。\n\n原指南建议，提交作业和参加测验，尤其是影响成绩的重要考核，应使用电脑。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "1. 登录与设备", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [3, 4], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、4 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662861-how-do-i-use-the-global-navigation-menu", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/664620-how-do-i-use-the-dashboard", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662809-how-do-i-view-all-my-canvas-courses", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662810-how-do-i-customize-my-courses-list", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662781-how-can-i-use-canvas-on-my-mobile-device", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products", "https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/hkust-ilearn/id954203479?mt=8", "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=hk.ust.itsc.tt.iLearn&hl=en&pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1", "mailto:canvas@ust.hk"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-d43025c1e7c737f2", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：登录后首页有哪些区域？\n回答：Dashboard 汇总各课程活动与待办事项。Global Navigation 提供 Courses、Groups、Calendar、SFQ 和 Inbox 等入口；课程卡片可显示公告、作业、讨论和文件，具体可见性取决于课程导航设置；侧栏显示待办、即将发生的事件、成绩与 SFQ 请求；Help 提供指南和支持。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2、3 页", "question": "登录后首页有哪些区域？", "answer": "Dashboard 汇总各课程活动与待办事项。Global Navigation 提供 Courses、Groups、Calendar、SFQ 和 Inbox 等入口；课程卡片可显示公告、作业、讨论和文件，具体可见性取决于课程导航设置；侧栏显示待办、即将发生的事件、成绩与 SFQ 请求；Help 提供指南和支持。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [2, 3], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2、3 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://canvas.ust.hk/", "mailto:cchelp@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662861-how-do-i-use-the-global-navigation-menu", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/664620-how-do-i-use-the-dashboard", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662809-how-do-i-view-all-my-canvas-courses", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662810-how-do-i-customize-my-courses-list", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662781-how-can-i-use-canvas-on-my-mobile-device", "https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/hkust-ilearn/id954203479?mt=8", "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=hk.ust.itsc.tt.iLearn&hl=en&pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-097bb392d816f48a", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：如何找到课程并设置收藏？\n回答：从左侧 Courses 选择课程；未显示时进入 All Courses。用星标收藏希望显示在 Dashboard 的课程。原文说明：未设置星标时，默认按字母排序显示最多 20 门课程；每学期可重新调整收藏。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、4 页", "question": "如何找到课程并设置收藏？", "answer": "从左侧 Courses 选择课程；未显示时进入 All Courses。用星标收藏希望显示在 Dashboard 的课程。原文说明：未设置星标时，默认按字母排序显示最多 20 门课程；每学期可重新调整收藏。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [3, 4], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、4 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662861-how-do-i-use-the-global-navigation-menu", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/664620-how-do-i-use-the-dashboard", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662809-how-do-i-view-all-my-canvas-courses", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662810-how-do-i-customize-my-courses-list", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662781-how-can-i-use-canvas-on-my-mobile-device", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products", "https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/hkust-ilearn/id954203479?mt=8", "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=hk.ust.itsc.tt.iLearn&hl=en&pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1", "mailto:canvas@ust.hk"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-9d920917155026c9", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：已选课但找不到课程，如何排查？\n回答：1. 进入 Courses → All Courses，排除首页显示数量限制。\n2. 若课程已在 All Courses，说明已成功加入该课程。\n3. 若课程变灰、Published 为 No，说明教师尚未发布；联系教师确认。\n4. SIS 选课信息每日同步，选课或退课后等待最多 24 小时。\n5. 候补名单学生需正式选上后才获得访问权限。\n6. 正式选课超过 24 小时仍缺失，向 canvas@ust.hk 提供课程代码和班别。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "question": "已选课但找不到课程，如何排查？", "answer": "1. 进入 Courses → All Courses，排除首页显示数量限制。\n2. 若课程已在 All Courses，说明已成功加入该课程。\n3. 若课程变灰、Published 为 No，说明教师尚未发布；联系教师确认。\n4. SIS 选课信息每日同步，选课或退课后等待最多 24 小时。\n5. 候补名单学生需正式选上后才获得访问权限。\n6. 正式选课超过 24 小时仍缺失，向 canvas@ust.hk 提供课程代码和班别。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [4], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-e46b591bcd9fa583", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：能看到课程但打不开，是什么原因？\n回答：课程可能尚未发布，也可能教师未选择使用 Canvas。向教师确认，并在 SIS 查询正式课程信息；同时检查浏览器和应用是否已更新。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "question": "能看到课程但打不开，是什么原因？", "answer": "课程可能尚未发布，也可能教师未选择使用 Canvas。向教师确认，并在 SIS 查询正式课程信息；同时检查浏览器和应用是否已更新。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [4], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-37a39cca645c7e2c", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：Canvas 日历为什么没有正式课表？\n回答：Canvas Calendar 显示 Canvas 课程的作业和事件。正式上课时间表应查询 SIS。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "question": "Canvas 日历为什么没有正式课表？", "answer": "Canvas Calendar 显示 Canvas 课程的作业和事件。正式上课时间表应查询 SIS。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [4], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-dcc7a9b120c64627", "text": "主题：2. 首页与课程管理\n问题：课程结束后还能访问吗？\n回答：课程结束后通常变为只读：可查看已发布内容，但不能继续提交或讨论。教师也可能取消发布材料或隐藏课程，具体情况向教师或助教确认。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "question": "课程结束后还能访问吗？", "answer": "课程结束后通常变为只读：可查看已发布内容，但不能继续提交或讨论。教师也可能取消发布材料或隐藏课程，具体情况向教师或助教确认。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "2. 首页与课程管理", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [5], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662720-how-do-i-clear-my-browser-cache-and-cookies", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661313-how-do-i-view-modules-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661210-how-do-i-submit-an-online-assignment"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-33fe8366d17fa388", "text": "主题：3. 通知与页面故障\n问题：如何设置邮件通知？\n回答：通知可按类别设置为即时、每日、每周或从不，可采用全局设置或逐门课程设置。原指南建议公告使用即时通知。移动应用推送设置会覆盖浏览器设置，部分偏好可能不受应用支持。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4、5 页", "question": "如何设置邮件通知？", "answer": "通知可按类别设置为即时、每日、每周或从不，可采用全局设置或逐门课程设置。原指南建议公告使用即时通知。移动应用推送设置会覆盖浏览器设置，部分偏好可能不受应用支持。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "3. 通知与页面故障", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [4, 5], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 4、5 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662720-how-do-i-clear-my-browser-cache-and-cookies", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661313-how-do-i-view-modules-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661210-how-do-i-submit-an-online-assignment"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-bb118e939d5d43d4", "text": "主题：3. 通知与页面故障\n问题：页面提示 Disallowed Key Characters 怎么办？\n回答：依次更新浏览器、清理缓存和 Cookies、重启浏览器。若通过旧书签访问，改从 Canvas 主站进入目标页面。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "question": "页面提示 Disallowed Key Characters 怎么办？", "answer": "依次更新浏览器、清理缓存和 Cookies、重启浏览器。若通过旧书签访问，改从 Canvas 主站进入目标页面。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "3. 通知与页面故障", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [5], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662720-how-do-i-clear-my-browser-cache-and-cookies", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661313-how-do-i-view-modules-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661210-how-do-i-submit-an-online-assignment"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-7f584ec30a70ccf6", "text": "主题：4. 学习材料与作业\n问题：Modules 是什么？\n回答：Modules 相当于课程目录，用于组织文件、页面、视频、考核和讨论等内容，可按周次、课堂或主题排列，具体结构由教师决定。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "question": "Modules 是什么？", "answer": "Modules 相当于课程目录，用于组织文件、页面、视频、考核和讨论等内容，可按周次、课堂或主题排列，具体结构由教师决定。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "4. 学习材料与作业", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [5], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662720-how-do-i-clear-my-browser-cache-and-cookies", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661313-how-do-i-view-modules-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661210-how-do-i-submit-an-online-assignment"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-013c1249061d2970", "text": "主题：4. 学习材料与作业\n问题：如何提交作业和多个附件？\n回答：在 Modules 或 Assignments 查找作业，也可能通过 Syllabus 或 To Do 的链接进入。打开作业后，点击右上方 Start Assignment，按作业要求提交。上传首个文件后，可点击 + Add Another File 添加其他附件。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5、6 页", "question": "如何提交作业和多个附件？", "answer": "在 Modules 或 Assignments 查找作业，也可能通过 Syllabus 或 To Do 的链接进入。打开作业后，点击右上方 Start Assignment，按作业要求提交。上传首个文件后，可点击 + Add Another File 添加其他附件。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "4. 学习材料与作业", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [5, 6], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 5、6 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662720-how-do-i-clear-my-browser-cache-and-cookies", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661313-how-do-i-view-modules-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661210-how-do-i-submit-an-online-assignment"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-c050b7ad19644a3f", "text": "主题：4. 学习材料与作业\n问题：重新提交会覆盖之前的作业吗？\n回答：能否重新提交由教师设置决定。允许重交时，教师可以查看所有已提交文件，学生只能看到最近一次提交。若误重交，应告知教师，因为教师可能只批改最新提交。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 6 页", "question": "重新提交会覆盖之前的作业吗？", "answer": "能否重新提交由教师设置决定。允许重交时，教师可以查看所有已提交文件，学生只能看到最近一次提交。若误重交，应告知教师，因为教师可能只批改最新提交。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "4. 学习材料与作业", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [6], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 6 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": [], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-f8993a3ea7128857", "text": "主题：4. 学习材料与作业\n问题：如何提交 Turnitin 作业并查看相似度？\n回答：教师配置后，直接通过 Canvas Assignments 提交，与普通作业流程相同；是否可交多个文件取决于设置。若允许查看报告，在作业右侧 Submission Details 中查找百分比形式的相似度图标。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 6 页", "question": "如何提交 Turnitin 作业并查看相似度？", "answer": "教师配置后，直接通过 Canvas Assignments 提交，与普通作业流程相同；是否可交多个文件取决于设置。若允许查看报告，在作业右侧 Submission Details 中查找百分比形式的相似度图标。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "4. 学习材料与作业", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [6], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 6 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": [], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-1779b59c0360033f", "text": "主题：4. 学习材料与作业\n问题：如何上传和嵌入媒体？\n回答：在使用 Rich Content Editor 的位置，可上传并嵌入受支持的媒体文件。原文给出的上限为 500 MB；更大文件可放在外部平台（例如 YouTube）再嵌入。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "question": "如何上传和嵌入媒体？", "answer": "在使用 Rich Content Editor 的位置，可上传并嵌入受支持的媒体文件。原文给出的上限为 500 MB；更大文件可放在外部平台（例如 YouTube）再嵌入。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "4. 学习材料与作业", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [7], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661350-how-do-i-take-a-quiz", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662920-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661305-how-do-i-view-my-grades-in-a-current-course", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661331-how-do-i-view-my-canvas-groups-as-a-student"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-2b5f924bf5f71b8a", "text": "主题：5. 测验与成绩\n问题：参加测验前需要准备什么？\n回答：使用可靠电脑和稳定网络，更新 Chrome 或 Firefox，避免隐私或无痕模式，关闭多余标签页和窗口。熟悉题目导航与标记功能；仔细阅读时间限制、尝试次数、答案可见性、截止时间和锁定时间。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "question": "参加测验前需要准备什么？", "answer": "使用可靠电脑和稳定网络，更新 Chrome 或 Firefox，避免隐私或无痕模式，关闭多余标签页和窗口。熟悉题目导航与标记功能；仔细阅读时间限制、尝试次数、答案可见性、截止时间和锁定时间。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "5. 测验与成绩", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [7], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661350-how-do-i-take-a-quiz", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662920-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661305-how-do-i-view-my-grades-in-a-current-course", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661331-how-do-i-view-my-canvas-groups-as-a-student"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-51a04c94e5611606", "text": "主题：5. 测验与成绩\n问题：测验过程中需要注意什么？\n回答：关注计时器，通过题目导航与标记回看题目，避免同时打开多个测验标签页或窗口。完成后正式提交，离开页面不等于提交。若允许，可复查答案。Canvas 会记录测验活动；发生问题时立即联系教师或助教，各次测验规则可能不同。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "question": "测验过程中需要注意什么？", "answer": "关注计时器，通过题目导航与标记回看题目，避免同时打开多个测验标签页或窗口。完成后正式提交，离开页面不等于提交。若允许，可复查答案。Canvas 会记录测验活动；发生问题时立即联系教师或助教，各次测验规则可能不同。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "5. 测验与成绩", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [7], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661350-how-do-i-take-a-quiz", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662920-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661305-how-do-i-view-my-grades-in-a-current-course", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661331-how-do-i-view-my-canvas-groups-as-a-student"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-969f839348254072", "text": "主题：5. 测验与成绩\n问题：在哪里查看成绩？\n回答：在 Dashboard 侧栏的 View Grades 查看各课程成绩汇总；进入具体课程后，通过左侧 Grades 查看该课程成绩。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "question": "在哪里查看成绩？", "answer": "在 Dashboard 侧栏的 View Grades 查看各课程成绩汇总；进入具体课程后，通过左侧 Grades 查看该课程成绩。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "5. 测验与成绩", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [7], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661350-how-do-i-take-a-quiz", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662920-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661305-how-do-i-view-my-grades-in-a-current-course", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661331-how-do-i-view-my-canvas-groups-as-a-student"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-c1183f6bd813b8fd", "text": "主题：6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作\n问题：在哪里找到小组空间？\n回答：可从课程首页右侧 Course Groups、课程 People 中的 Groups 标签，或全局导航 Groups 菜单进入所属小组。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "question": "在哪里找到小组空间？", "answer": "可从课程首页右侧 Course Groups、课程 People 中的 Groups 标签，或全局导航 Groups 菜单进入所属小组。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [7], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 7 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661350-how-do-i-take-a-quiz", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662920-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661305-how-do-i-view-my-grades-in-a-current-course", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661331-how-do-i-view-my-canvas-groups-as-a-student"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-cbb2c0570923bc8c", "text": "主题：6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作\n问题：如何自行加入小组？\n回答：进入课程 → People → View User Groups 或 Groups 标签，找到目标小组后点击 JOIN。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "question": "如何自行加入小组？", "answer": "进入课程 → People → View User Groups 或 Groups 标签，找到目标小组后点击 JOIN。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [8], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661333-how-do-i-join-a-group-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661215-how-do-i-submit-an-assignment-on-behalf-of-a-group", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662866-how-do-i-send-a-message-to-a-user-in-a-course-in-the-inbox", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/step-clear-o365-token-in-canvas.pdf", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/troubleshoot-canvas-google-drive-issues.pdf", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/canvas-lms-student-guide"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-a0d88608ebc45eb5", "text": "主题：6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作\n问题：小组作业需要每人都交吗？\n回答：通常由一名成员代表全组提交即可；同时遵守教师对该作业的具体提交要求。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "question": "小组作业需要每人都交吗？", "answer": "通常由一名成员代表全组提交即可；同时遵守教师对该作业的具体提交要求。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [8], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661333-how-do-i-join-a-group-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661215-how-do-i-submit-an-assignment-on-behalf-of-a-group", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662866-how-do-i-send-a-message-to-a-user-in-a-course-in-the-inbox", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/step-clear-o365-token-in-canvas.pdf", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/troubleshoot-canvas-google-drive-issues.pdf", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/canvas-lms-student-guide"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-324a1b864ef4b182", "text": "主题：6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作\n问题：如何联系教师、同学或组员？\n回答：使用 Inbox（Conversations）与已加入课程中的人员交流。功能类似邮件，但原文说明没有抄送和拼写检查。需要即时邮件提醒时，将 Conversations 通知设为 Notify immediately。原文对 Inbox 位置的描述不一致，使用界面中标有 Inbox 的入口即可。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、8 页", "question": "如何联系教师、同学或组员？", "answer": "使用 Inbox（Conversations）与已加入课程中的人员交流。功能类似邮件，但原文说明没有抄送和拼写检查。需要即时邮件提醒时，将 Conversations 通知设为 Notify immediately。原文对 Inbox 位置的描述不一致，使用界面中标有 Inbox 的入口即可。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [3, 8], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 3、8 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662861-how-do-i-use-the-global-navigation-menu", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/664620-how-do-i-use-the-dashboard", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662809-how-do-i-view-all-my-canvas-courses", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662810-how-do-i-customize-my-courses-list", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662781-how-can-i-use-canvas-on-my-mobile-device", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products", "https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/hkust-ilearn/id954203479?mt=8", "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=hk.ust.itsc.tt.iLearn&hl=en&pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661333-how-do-i-join-a-group-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661215-how-do-i-submit-an-assignment-on-behalf-of-a-group", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662866-how-do-i-send-a-message-to-a-user-in-a-course-in-the-inbox", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/step-clear-o365-token-in-canvas.pdf", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/troubleshoot-canvas-google-drive-issues.pdf", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/canvas-lms-student-guide"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-f3feef24d1e8e876", "text": "主题：6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作\n问题：Office 365 或 Google Drive 无法连接怎么办？\n回答：原指南要求重置对应服务的授权令牌（token）。Office 365 场景为 Collaborations 登录失败；Google Drive 场景包括 Collaborations 连接失败或提交 Google Docs 失败。原文只链接到排查说明，没有列出重置步骤；请通过来源链接查阅，本文不补造操作流程。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "question": "Office 365 或 Google Drive 无法连接怎么办？", "answer": "原指南要求重置对应服务的授权令牌（token）。Office 365 场景为 Collaborations 登录失败；Google Drive 场景包括 Collaborations 连接失败或提交 Google Docs 失败。原文只链接到排查说明，没有列出重置步骤；请通过来源链接查阅，本文不补造操作流程。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "6. 小组、沟通与第三方协作", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [8], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 8 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661333-how-do-i-join-a-group-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661215-how-do-i-submit-an-assignment-on-behalf-of-a-group", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662866-how-do-i-send-a-message-to-a-user-in-a-course-in-the-inbox", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/step-clear-o365-token-in-canvas.pdf", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/troubleshoot-canvas-google-drive-issues.pdf", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/canvas-lms-student-guide"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-f8b1ed8e2ef739a0", "text": "主题：7. 支持、版权与使用条款\n问题：在哪里查找帮助或报告问题？\n回答：通过 Canvas 的 Help → Search the Canvas Guides 检索学生指南。原文支持渠道如下：\n\n| 问题类型 | 邮箱 | 电话 | 服务时间（原文） |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 登录和 ITSO 支持 | cchelp@ust.hk | 2358-6200 | 未列出 |\n| Canvas、课程缺失和账号相关咨询 | canvas@ust.hk | 2358-8036 | 周一至周五 09:00–12:45、14:00–17:30 |\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2、4、8、9 页", "question": "在哪里查找帮助或报告问题？", "answer": "通过 Canvas 的 Help → Search the Canvas Guides 检索学生指南。原文支持渠道如下：\n\n| 问题类型 | 邮箱 | 电话 | 服务时间（原文） |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 登录和 ITSO 支持 | cchelp@ust.hk | 2358-6200 | 未列出 |\n| Canvas、课程缺失和账号相关咨询 | canvas@ust.hk | 2358-8036 | 周一至周五 09:00–12:45、14:00–17:30 |", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "7. 支持、版权与使用条款", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [2, 4, 8, 9], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 2、4、8、9 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["https://canvas.ust.hk/", "mailto:cchelp@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662718-what-are-the-browser-and-computer-requirements-for-instructure-products", "mailto:canvas@ust.hk", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661333-how-do-i-join-a-group-as-a-student", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661215-how-do-i-submit-an-assignment-on-behalf-of-a-group", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662866-how-do-i-send-a-message-to-a-user-in-a-course-in-the-inbox", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/387041-unknown", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/662894-how-do-i-manage-my-canvas-notification-settings", "https://community.canvaslms.com/t5/Canvas-Student-Android-Guide/How-do-I-set-Notification-Preferences-in-the-Student-app-on-my/ta-p/1848", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661630-unknown", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/step-clear-o365-token-in-canvas.pdf", "https://cei.hkust.edu.hk/sites/default/files/content/canvas/troubleshoot-canvas-google-drive-issues.pdf", "https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/canvas-lms-student-guide", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528!en@2007-07-06T00:00:00", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/fair-dealing-instruction", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/friendly.php?s=copyright/licensed-text", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/start", "https://ilearn.ust.hk/canvas/canvas-user-agreement/index.html", "http://www.instructure.com/policies/terms-of-use", "https://www.instructure.com/privacy-security"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-fa464a80224c21fc", "text": "主题：7. 支持、版权与使用条款\n问题：原指南对教学材料版权有哪些说明？\n回答：原文以香港版权条例下的公平处理（Fair Dealing）为背景，说明教学使用版权作品需符合合理数量及相应条件。上传至内联网的材料需注明来源、设置登录等访问控制，并仅向有需要的特定师生限时提供；原文列出的最长连续上传期限为 12 个月。也可考虑由图书馆链接已订阅资源，或通过课程资料包取得许可。\n\n以上是原文件内容摘要，不代表对当前法规的独立核实。原文版权咨询联系人为 Victoria F. Caplan，分机 6756，lbcaplan@ust.hk。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 9 页", "question": "原指南对教学材料版权有哪些说明？", "answer": "原文以香港版权条例下的公平处理（Fair Dealing）为背景，说明教学使用版权作品需符合合理数量及相应条件。上传至内联网的材料需注明来源、设置登录等访问控制，并仅向有需要的特定师生限时提供；原文列出的最长连续上传期限为 12 个月。也可考虑由图书馆链接已订阅资源，或通过课程资料包取得许可。\n\n以上是原文件内容摘要，不代表对当前法规的独立核实。原文版权咨询联系人为 Victoria F. Caplan，分机 6756，lbcaplan@ust.hk。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "7. 支持、版权与使用条款", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [9], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 9 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528!en@2007-07-06T00:00:00", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/fair-dealing-instruction", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/friendly.php?s=copyright/licensed-text", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/start", "https://ilearn.ust.hk/canvas/canvas-user-agreement/index.html", "http://www.instructure.com/policies/terms-of-use", "https://www.instructure.com/privacy-security"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
{"id": "hkust-canvas-2002a6d6cc7d0d2c", "text": "主题：7. 支持、版权与使用条款\n问题：使用 Canvas 涉及哪些条款？\n回答：原指南说明，使用 HKUST Canvas 涉及学校 Canvas 用户协议、Instructure 使用条款以及隐私政策。完整链接见本条 metadata.related_links（同页链接，未逐项匹配） 中 PDF 第 9 页记录；应以协议原文为准。\n来源：HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 9 页", "question": "使用 Canvas 涉及哪些条款？", "answer": "原指南说明，使用 HKUST Canvas 涉及学校 Canvas 用户协议、Instructure 使用条款以及隐私政策。完整链接见本条 metadata.related_links（同页链接，未逐项匹配） 中 PDF 第 9 页记录；应以协议原文为准。", "metadata": {"document_id": "hkust_canvas_student_guide", "source_file": "hkust_canvas_student_guide.pdf", "source_sha256": "3748369b5a134a5509f1e9052dbc3d1aa9b530646b6242afce6ebde64a9dfd11", "source_title": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide", "topic": "7. 支持、版权与使用条款", "language": "zh-CN", "pdf_pages": [9], "citation": "HKUST Canvas Student Guide，PDF 第 9 页", "transformed_on": "2026-10-29", "source_published_on": null, "currentness_verified": false, "content_type": "rewritten_qa", "related_links": ["mailto:canvas@ust.hk", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528", "https://www.elegislation.gov.hk/hk/cap528!en@2007-07-06T00:00:00", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/fair-dealing-instruction", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/friendly.php?s=copyright/licensed-text", "https://libguides.hkust.edu.hk/copyright/start", "https://ilearn.ust.hk/canvas/canvas-user-agreement/index.html", "http://www.instructure.com/policies/terms-of-use", "https://www.instructure.com/privacy-security"], "related_links_scope": "same_pdf_pages_not_individually_matched"}}
